# --- `dotf spec review` state (fleet convention: ts-bridge #340, kubelab) -------
# The reviewer transcript is its full tool-call log and runs to megabytes (3.6 MB for
# one SEC-001 run), and review-request.json is the launcher's own record. Neither is
# spec contract. `review.md` stays tracked: it is the signed verdict the archive gate
# reads, so a FAIL verdict is committed rather than left on someone's disk.
specs/**/review-transcript.jsonl
specs/**/review-transcript.jsonl.stderr
specs/**/review-request.json
